    "text": "arkadelphian.com\nwebsite\nClark County, Arkansas\nATV crash near Amity claims life of Central Arkansas man\n11 hours ago\nAMITY, Arkansas — A Scott man was killed in a single vehicle ATV crash Tuesday morning in Clark County. According to Sheriff Jason Watson, 48-year-old Bryan Earl Taylor, of Scott, was riding his four-wheeler near Amity Landing around 7:57 a.m. Tuesday morning, Oct. 7, 2025, when his right rear tire left the roadway, causing him to be thrown from the vehicle and into a tree.\n3\nComments\nYOU MAY ALSO LIKE\nThe HD Post\n·\nuser · 21.5K followers",
